{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o171a","title":"槛车征邓艾","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o171a-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"槛车征邓艾","evidence":["shaodi-e-o171a-q"]},{"id":"wgc-a-4-e20","label":"正文","text":"诏书槛车征邓艾","evidence":["wgc-q0398","wgc-q0056"]},{"id":"wgc-a-7-e9","label":"正文","text":"诏书槛车征邓艾","evidence":["wgc-q0485","wgc-q0079"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0080","role":"被征","evidence":["shaodi-e-o171a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":264,"label":"春正月壬戌","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y264","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o171","basis":"春正月壬戌"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-o171a-q","shaodi-q-o171","shaodi-q-o165","shaodi-q-b-ded6d700dc6f860d1670"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-o171a-q","source_order":[4,813,"O171a"],"order":1279}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0080","name":"邓艾","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o171a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-cef469d41ec5962b4e48","layer":"original","quote":"咸熙元年春正月，壬戌〖1〗，槛车征邓艾〖2〗。甲子〖3〗，行幸长安。壬申〖4〗，使使者以璧币祀华山〖5〗。是月，钟会反于蜀，为众所讨。邓艾亦见杀。二月，辛卯〖6〗，特赦诸在益土者。庚申〖7〗，葬明元郭后。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":220,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":102},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-ded6d700dc6f860d1670","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-ded6d700dc6f860d1670","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗四年：景元四年（公元 263）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":201,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-ef642248e44d01f3825d","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"shaodi-q-o165","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b35fdf03685051716720","layer":"original","quote":"四年春二月〖1〗，复命大将军进位、爵赐，一如前诏。又固辞，乃止。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":194,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":32},{"id":"shaodi-q-o171","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-cef469d41ec5962b4e48","layer":"original","quote":"咸熙元年春正月，壬戌〖1〗，槛车征邓艾〖2〗。甲子〖3〗，行幸长安。壬申〖4〗，使使者以璧币祀华山〖5〗。是月，钟会反于蜀，为众所讨。邓艾亦见杀。二月，辛卯〖6〗，特赦诸在益土者。庚申〖7〗，葬明元郭后。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":220,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":102},{"id":"wgc-q0056","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-2887f1d1c1602f289c32","layer":"original","quote":"钟会、胡烈、师纂等皆白艾所作悖逆，变衅已结〖28〗。诏书槛车征艾〖29〗。﹝二﹞","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":354,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40},{"id":"wgc-q0079","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-513967ffa2e8c3abfabc","layer":"original","quote":"会内有异志〖1〗，因邓艾承制专事，密白“艾有反状”；﹝一﹞于是诏书槛车征艾。司马文王惧艾或不从命，敕会并进军成都。监军卫瓘在会前行，以文王手笔令宣喻艾军；艾军皆释仗，遂收艾入槛车。会所惮惟艾，艾既擒而会寻至，独统大众，威震西土。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":558,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":114},{"id":"wgc-q0398","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-2887f1d1c1602f289c32","layer":"original","quote":"诏书槛车征艾","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":354,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":26,"end":32},{"id":"wgc-q0485","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-513967ffa2e8c3abfabc","layer":"original","quote":"于是诏书槛车征艾","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":558,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":29,"end":37}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
